      "line": 61,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 22,
      "source_quote": "尚書左僕射王愉、愉子荊州刺史綏等，江左冠族。",
      "note": "宋書明父子與末官。",
      "source_sha256": "2dec5991dd6fcc1ee82f680f915855cd9646e3f5202e7a5ac161890cd8806024"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu001-ws11136436.wikitext",
      "revision": 11136436,
      "line": 61,
      "start": 41,
      "end": 60,
      "source_quote": "綏，桓氏甥，亦有自疑之志。高祖悉誅之。",
      "note": "宋史另說其態度與死因。",
      "source_sha256": "2dec5991dd6fcc1ee82f680f915855cd9646e3f5202e7a5ac161890cd8806024"
    },
    {
